ous one.","town":"Watkins Glen","indoor":false,"drive":"45 min from Ithaca","url":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/142/"},{"name":"Cascadilla Gorge Trail","blurb":"Six waterfalls climbing from downtown Ithaca up to Cornell. Short and steep.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/our-gardens/natural-areas/cascadilla-gorge/"},{"name":"Ithaca Farmers Market","blurb":"Waterfront pavilion at Steamboat Landing. Sat 9-3, Sun 10-3. Food stalls, not just produce.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://ithacamarket.com/"},{"name":"Cornell Botanic Gardens","blurb":"Free. Herb garden, arboretum, and the Slim Jim Woods trails.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/"},{"name":"Stewart Park","blurb":"Cayuga Lake shoreline, carousel, big shade trees. Easy with no plan.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.cityofithaca.org/234/Stewart-Park"},{"name":"Lime Hollow Nature Center","blurb":"Boardwalks, bog, treehouse. Closest real nature to the Airbnb.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"10 min from Cortland","url":"https://limehollow.org/"},{"name":"Greek Peak Mountain Coaster","blurb":"Alpine coaster you control. Also a zipline and adventure center.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"15 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.greekpeak.net/"},{"name":"Cayuga Lake Wine Trail","blurb":"Tasting rooms up both shores. Sheldrake Point and Six Mile Creek are the easy picks.","town":"Cayuga Lake","indoor":false,"drive":"20-50 min","url":"https://cayugawinetrail.com/"},{"name":"Museum of the Earth","blurb":"Full mastodon and a right whale skeleton. Good rain plan, about 2 hours.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"30 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.museumoftheearth.org/"},{"name":"Herbert F. Johnson Museum of Art","blurb":"Free. I.M. Pei building, and the 5th floor has the best view of Cayuga Lake.","town":"Ithaca","